{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","title":"Receiving credentials"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Receiving-credentials","title":"Receiving credentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer offers credentials with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a QR code or a link the holder opens. Register the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open the app, and hand the link to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolves the offer and the issuer’s metadata, and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" whose ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer"},{"text":" you show the holder: who is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offering what.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offer names one of two grants:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Authorization code:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the holder signs in at the issuer’s pages, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a browser, which redirects back to the wallet’s redirect URI."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pre-authorized code:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" the issuer has already authenticated the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder, and may ask for a PIN it sent them separately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Either way, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" then requests, checks and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores the credentials, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends the issuance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Receive an offer","anchor":"Receive-an-offer"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import AuthenticationServices","import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Receives the credentials an offer link offers. `askPIN` asks the","\/\/\/ holder for the PIN the issuer sent, or returns nil if they cancel;","\/\/\/ `signIn` opens the issuer's page and returns the redirect back.","func receive(offerLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             askPIN: (Offer.TxCode?) async -> String?,","             signIn: (URL) async throws -> URL) async throws -> Issuance.Result? {","    let issuance = try await wallet.startIssuance(offer: offerLink)","    switch issuance.offer.grant {","    case .preAuthorizedCode:","        while true {","            guard let pin = await askPIN(issuance.offer.txCode) else {","                try await issuance.close()","                return nil","            }","            do {","                try await issuance.redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin: pin)","                break","            } catch let error as WalletError where error.isRetryable {","                continue \/\/ A wrong PIN (invalid_grant): ask again.","            }","        }","    case .authorizationCode:","        let url = try await issuance.beginAuthorization()","        let redirect = try await signIn(url)","        try await issuance.completeAuthorization(redirect: redirect)","    }","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" lists what arrived, what the issuer deferred, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what failed: one credential the issuer refused doesn’t hold up the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rest.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Open the issuer’s page","anchor":"Open-the-issuers-page","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the authorization URL in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"type":"text","text":", with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect URI’s scheme as its callback scheme. An ephemeral session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the issuer’s cookies out of Safari’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Opens issuers' authorization pages over `window`.","@MainActor","final class IssuerSignIn: NSObject, ASWebAuthenticationPresentationContextProviding {","    private let window: ASPresentationAnchor","    private let callbackScheme: String","","    init(window: ASPresentationAnchor, callbackScheme: String) {","        self.window = window","        self.callbackScheme = callbackScheme","    }","","    nonisolated func presentationAnchor(for session: ASWebAuthenticationSession) -> ASPresentationAnchor {","        MainActor.assumeIsolated { window }","    }","","    \/\/\/ The issuer's redirect back, or `ASWebAuthenticationSessionError`","    \/\/\/ `.canceledLogin` when the holder closes the page.","    func open(_ url: URL) async throws -> URL {","        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in","            let session = ASWebAuthenticationSession(url: url, callbackURLScheme: callbackScheme) { redirect, error in","                if let redirect {","                    continuation.resume(returning: redirect)","                } else {","                    continuation.resume(throwing: error ?? URLError(.unknown))","                }","            }","            session.presentationContextProvider = self","            session.prefersEphemeralWebBrowserSession = true","            session.start()","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the holder closes the page, the offer stays open:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" can begin again. A redirect is used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"up by ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" whatever happens,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so after a failure there, begin again rather than retrying it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Resume after the app is killed","anchor":"Resume-after-the-app-is-killed","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS can terminate the app while the holder is at the issuer’s pages.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The authorization in progress is kept in the credential store, so when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the redirect arrives at a relaunched app, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completes it and returns an issuance ready for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Handle every redirect this way: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":". Outside development, resuming needs a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"redirectURI"},{"type":"text","text":" with the app’s own URI scheme, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":", so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses an https Universal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Link there. In development too, the scheme must be a domain name in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reverse order followed by a single slash, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reverse.domain:\/path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(RFC 8252 §7.1): "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"myapp:\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:\/\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:callback"},{"type":"text","text":" as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidInput"},{"type":"text","text":", and any redirect URI with a fragment or credentials."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Completes an authorization the app was killed during, from the","\/\/\/ redirect iOS delivers to the relaunched app.","func resume(redirect: URL, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> Issuance.Result {","    let issuance = try await wallet.resumeIssuance(redirect: redirect)","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A redirect that matches no authorization in progress throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Wait for a deferred credential","type":"heading","anchor":"Wait-for-a-deferred-credential","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An issuer may issue a credential later, after a review, say. It’s kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned, so it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"survives the app quitting. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" lists them","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without network requests; poll each at the interval the issuer asks for.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Polls a deferred credential until the issuer settles it: the","\/\/\/ credential, or a `.credentialDenied` error.","func waitFor(_ deferred: DeferredCredential, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> CredentialSummary {","    var interval = deferred.intervalSeconds","    while true {","        try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(max(interval, 5)))","        switch try await wallet.pollDeferred(id: deferred.id) {","        case .issued(let credential): return credential","        case .pending(let next): interval = next","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" gives one up, deleting its keys: once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its access token has expired, say (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Look after held credentials","type":"heading","anchor":"Look-after-held-credentials","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()"},{"text":" lists them, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns one with its claims, for display. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries the issuer’s names, logos and colours, in the holder’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"language (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" checks revocation against the issuer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status list, which covers many credentials, so the issuer can’t tell"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which one is checked."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each credential arrives as a batch of copies, each bound to its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize"},{"type":"text","text":"), so presentations can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linked by the credential. When "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches zero, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" replaces them without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder, if the issuance kept a refresh token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh"},{"type":"text","text":"). Otherwise it throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": receive the credential again."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" deletes a credential and its keys,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revoking its refresh token at the issuer."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/deleteCredential(id:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"deleteCredential"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Deletes a credential and its holder keys, and its refresh grant","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"once no other credential uses it, first revoking the refresh token","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at the Authorization Server, best effort."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/deletecredential(id:)","title":"deleteCredential(id:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requestRefresh":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Asks Authorization Servers for a refresh token, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Wallet.refreshCredential(id:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can later replace a credential’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"copies without the holder. The server must allow the wallet the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"offline_access","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" scope, or the authorization fails.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requestrefresh","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requestRefresh"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"title":"requestRefresh","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/offer":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/offer","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"offer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Offer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet5OfferV"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"What’s offered: show it before going on.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"offer","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/resumeIssuance(redirect:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/resumeissuance(redirect:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resumeIssuance"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"redirect"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet8IssuanceC","text":"Issuance","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Completes an authorization begun before the app was suspended or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relaunched: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"redirect"},{"type":"text","text":" is the issuer’s redirect back to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect URI, delivered to the app ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":"). Returns the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuance ready for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestCredentials()"},{"type":"text","text":". A redirect matching no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization in progress — not this wallet’s, already completed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or expired — throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".notFound"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"resumeIssuance(redirect:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/copiesLeft":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"copiesLeft","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/copiesleft","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How many copies no Verifier has seen."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"copiesLeft"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/deferredCredentials()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deferredCredentials","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredCredential","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet18DeferredCredentialV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The credentials issuers have deferred and not yet settled, oldest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first — including ones from before the app last quit. Makes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network calls: poll each at its interval."}],"type":"topic","title":"deferredCredentials()","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/deferredcredentials()","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","title":"OID4VCWallet","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/beginAuthorization()":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Begins the authorization code grant, returning the issuer’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authorization URL to open in an ","type":"text"},{"code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Calling it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again begins again: after the holder closed the page, say.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/beginauthorization()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"beginAuthorization"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"beginAuthorization()","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/locales":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/locales","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"locales"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"title":"locales","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The holder’s preferred languages (BCP 47, most preferred first),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for issuers’ display metadata. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Locale.preferredLanguages"},{"type":"text","text":" is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"usual choice."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredCredential":{"identif